the second, ^^BETTERMENT^^ for improvement, ^^HAPPENINGS^^ for events, *english* for translate (into English), ^^FOLK^^ for people, & ^^FOREBEAR^^ for ancestor; of the third, ^^BELITTLE^^ & *depreciate*, *wheelman* & *cyclist*, *love* & *charity* (*1 Corinthians* xiii, A. V. & R. V.), *burgess* or *burgher* & *citizen*.
